[statement]
A package installed for its condition has its dependencies decided where the
walk reaches the package, from the package its condition names: `base`,
listed first, leads to `e`, which needs `F`, so `F` is decided before `S`,
which `z` needs, and `f1` holds `K`, which leaves `s2` for `S`. Contrast
`a-dependency-is-decided-where-the-walk-reaches-the-package-z-first`.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:base z

P:base
V:1

P:z
V:1
D:S

P:e
V:1
i:base
D:F

P:f1
V:1
k:100
p:F K=1

P:f2
V:1
k:10
p:F

P:s1
V:1
k:100
p:S K=1

P:s2
V:1
k:10
p:S

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install base 1
install f1 1
install e 1
install s2 1
install z 1
install top 1
